MIT License

Applies to the model artifacts in this branch: the ONNX graphs
(`tokenizer-encode.onnx`, `tokenizer-decode.onnx`, `kronos-decode.onnx`,
`kronos-s2head.onnx`), `model-manifest.json` and this README.

These files are a format conversion (PyTorch → ONNX) of the Kronos weights
published by NeoQuasar, from the project https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos,
which is distributed under the MIT License. The upstream copyright and
permission notice below is retained as the license requires.

Note: the fbtcryp / fbtswap.ir application that consumes these files is a
separate work with its own (proprietary) license. Nothing here grants any right
to that application's source code.

